 ## Data Expectations
 - Outputs/reference files should be JSON arrays. Each element may be a string or object containing `text`/`output` fields.
 - Future work: support tabular CSV, scored datasets, multi-turn conversations.
 
+## Threshold Gating
+- `generateReport` accepts an optional `thresholds` object (e.g., `{ exact_match: 0.9 }`).
+- Reports include a top-level `passed` boolean and a `thresholds` list with `{ metric, min, score, passed }` entries.
+- Metrics with no score (e.g., exact match without references) fail their thresholds.
+- CLI exit codes: 0 (all pass or no thresholds), 1 (threshold failed), 2 (malformed threshold or unknown metric).
+- Markdown reports show a "Thresholds" section with PASS/FAIL status per metric.
